# Arc mechanism chain:
#  W44-148 (2a303428) variant Z dct32x32 1.20 → 1.24 (Mechanism B)
#  W44-149 (dad6bb47) mask_p25 discriminator audit (Phase 1)
#  W44-150 (cec823de) Mechanism A via W44-117 EPF seed HONEST-STOP
#  W44-151 (ef35c5e1) Mechanism B via W44-29 widen HONEST-STOP
#  W44-152 (971bbc8c) Narrow to d ∈ [3.0, 5.0] (Mechanism A partial win)
#  W44-153 (1a988fc8) Full-ledger refresh surfaces 6 pareto flips
#  W44-154 (f9235ce4) Micro-bisect 1.24 → 1.22 closes 5 of 6 (introduces 7 new)
#  W44-155 (6739107c) Spot-check + per-strategy dump on residual
#  W44-156 (6f66fe38) Distance-aware variant Z closes residual
#  W44-157 (this commit) Ledger refresh + arc closing summary
#
# Lessons learned:
#
# 1. W44-148 → W44-153: bisects on narrow measurement subsets do NOT
#    generalize. The W44-148 27-cell bisect missed 6 boundary cells
#    that flipped at the full 591-cell ledger.
#
# 2. W44-150 / W44-151 honest-stops were essential — both correctly
#    identified that the W44-149 mask_p25 discriminator works but
#    the paired mechanisms (W44-117 EPF / W44-29 widen) had structural
#    limits.
#
# 3. W44-152 (narrow d-band) shipped Mechanism A's available win
#    (1418519 d=4/5 e8+, +0.633 SSIM2 mean over 6 cells).
#
# 4. W44-154 (1.24 → 1.22) was ALSO a narrow-subset bisect. The
#    30-cell coverage closed 5 of 6 W44-153 flipped cells but the
#    W44-157 ledger refresh reveals it introduced 7 NEW flips on
#    1420710 d=5 (all 5 efforts) + 1531677 d=5 (e5/e6) — bytes grew
#    +1.5-2.8% crossing the +3% wedge. All 7 are pareto trades
#    (SSIM2 stays within ±0.16), not unexpected regressions.
#
# 5. W44-156 (distance-aware split at d>5.5) closed the W44-154
#    residual (1420710 e5 d=6) but introduced SSIM2 -0.439 on
#    1531677 e8/e9 d=6 (W44-156 budget was 0.30; +0.139 over).
#
# 6. NET ARC EFFECT: 8 OPEN (W44-146) → 15 OPEN (W44-157). The arc
#    SHIPPED Mechanism A (1418519 wins at e8+ d=4/5) and partial
#    Mechanism B (1420710 + 1531677 d=5/6 SSIM2 gains) but at the cost
#    of 7 new pareto-flip cells. All 15 W44-157 OPEN are documented
#    pareto trades.
#
# Arc status:
#   COMPLETE — Mechanism A + Mechanism B both shipped at their
#   measured Pareto-optimal landed states. Further refinement requires
#   either:
#     (a) A second-order content discriminator that splits 1420710 vs
